flowchart LR
    RawCountries[Raw Countries] --> RoutesTable(Routes Lookup Table)
    RawCommodities[Raw Commodities] --> CommodityTable(Commodity Groups Lookup Table)

    RoutesTable --> RouteGroup[Route Group Name]
    CommodityTable --> CommodityCategory[Commodity Category Name]

    RouteGroup --> BaseRater[Base Rater Permutation Table]
    CommodityCategory --> BaseRater

    BaseRater --> RatingEngine(Rating Engine)
    RatingEngine --> ShipmentPricing[Shipment Pricing]

    AdminBroker(Admins and Brokers) --> RoutesTable
    AdminBroker --> CommodityTable